  "description": "It’s time to leave the car at home. With the Momentum new city e-bike Cito E+, it’s easier and faster to get around than ever before. Whether you’re taking kids to school, heading to work, getting groceries, or seeing friends, Cito E+ offers you more fun, flexibility and freedom to get you there! Cito E+ offers much more than your average city e-bike. With throttle assist up to 20MPH and pedal assist up to 28MPH, you can get where you need to go, without breaking a sweat. With a range up to 75 miles on a single charge, you can go just about anywhere. The options are endless, with a high weight load capacity and a wide range of accessories, Cito E+ really can do it all! An E-bike designed for everyone. Ride confidently, knowing the Cito E+ offers best tech and safety features on the road. The battery is co-developed with Panasonic and designed to meet the highest safety standards. Be seen and heard! The Cito E+ comes equipped with a powerful LED running head light, brake lights, turn signals, and E-horn. It isn’t all GO; with 4-piston hydraulic disc brakes, you can stop safely in all conditions.",
